#: ../inc/settings.php:573
msgid "WebP delivery"
msgstr "Entrega WebP"

#: ../inc/settings.php:574
msgid "Choose how WebP files are stored and served. Pick one strategy."
msgstr ""
"Elija cómo se almacenan y sirven los archivos WebP. Seleccione una "
"estrategia."

#: ../inc/settings.php:576, ../inc/settings.php:997
msgid "WebP delivery mode"
msgstr "Modo de entrega WebP"

#: ../inc/settings.php:585
msgid "Thumbnails & limits"
msgstr "Miniaturas y límites"

#: ../inc/settings.php:586
msgid "Which generated sizes to squeeze, resize limits, and timeout."
msgstr ""
"Qué tamaños generados comprimir, límites de redimensionado y tiempo de "
"espera."

#: ../inc/settings.php:595
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr "Exclusiones"

#: ../inc/settings.php:596
msgid "Skip matching files during bulk or upload squeeze."
msgstr "Omitir archivos coincidentes durante la compresión masiva o al subir."

#: ../inc/settings.php:606
msgid "Summary and help"
msgstr "Resumen y ayuda"

#: ../inc/settings.php:626
msgid "JPEG Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Ajustes avanzados JPEG"

#: ../inc/settings.php:679
msgid "Documentation for Squeeze plugin."
msgstr "Documentación del plugin Squeeze."

#: ../inc/settings.php:689
msgid ""
"For more information, please visit the <a href=\"%s\" "
"target=\"_blank\">official documentation website</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para más información, visite la <a href=\"%s\" target=\"_blank\">web "
"oficial de documentación</a>."

#: ../inc/settings.php:705, ../inc/settings.php:793, ../inc/settings.php:1411
msgid "Upgrade to Premium"
msgstr "Actualizar a Premium"

#: ../inc/settings.php:714
msgid "Image Comparison"
msgstr "Comparación de imágenes"

#: ../inc/settings.php:715
msgid ""
"Slide between the original and squeezed image in the Media Library so you "
"can judge quality before you commit."
msgstr ""
"Deslice entre la imagen original y la comprimida en la biblioteca de medios "
"para valorar la calidad antes de confirmar."

#: ../inc/settings.php:719
msgid "Bulk Squeeze from a Page"
msgstr "Compresión masiva desde una página"

#: ../inc/settings.php:724
msgid "Resize Original Image"
msgstr "Redimensionar imagen original"

#: ../inc/settings.php:725
msgid ""
"Cap original width and height so huge phone photos never land full-size on "
"your server."
msgstr ""
"Limite el ancho y alto original para que las fotos enormes del móvil no "
"lleguen a tamaño completo a su servidor."

#: ../inc/settings.php:729
msgid "CDN URL mapping"
msgstr "Asignación de URL CDN"

#: ../inc/settings.php:730
msgid ""
"Map CDN URLs back to local files so Squeeze still finds and compresses "
"Offload Media / CDN images."
msgstr ""
"Asigne las URL CDN a archivos locales para que Squeeze siga encontrando y "
"comprimiendo imágenes de Offload Media / CDN."

#: ../inc/settings.php:734
msgid "Elementor on upload"
msgstr "Elementor al subir"

#: ../inc/settings.php:735
msgid ""
"Compress images in the browser when they are uploaded through Elementor, "
"before they hit your media library."
msgstr ""
"Comprima imágenes en el navegador al subirlas con Elementor, antes de que "
"lleguen a su biblioteca de medios."

#: ../inc/settings.php:739
msgid "Gravity Forms uploads"
msgstr ""

#: ../inc/settings.php:740
msgid ""
"Compress visitor photos in the browser on Gravity Forms single- and "
"multi-file fields before they hit your server."
msgstr ""

#: ../inc/settings.php:758
msgid "$4.99 / month"
